WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.965
From the watchlist
on the monitor tab,

2
00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:18.840
click the underlying
symbol you wish

3
00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.540
to create your covered
coal trade for.

4
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.920
So long has your tabs or parts
of the same Windows group,

5
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:28.470
the underlying will appear
in the order entry panel.

6
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.855
To the right of the
order entry panel,

7
00:00:30.855 --> 00:00:34.410
select "Strategy Builder"
from the dropdown menu.

8
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:38.340
You will see the option chain
window populate the screen.

9
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.600
To the lower left,

10
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.615
ensure that the Strategy
Builder button set to on.

11
00:00:43.615 --> 00:00:45.605
If you see off,

12
00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:48.070
just click the
button to activate.

13
00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:50.600
To create a covered call, first,

14
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.680
the call option must be

15
00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.820
identified before the
stock leg is added.

16
00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.740
Strategy builder
displays option chains

17
00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.000
at the top of the page with

18
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.860
Call options to the left and Put

19
00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.935
options to the rights of
the central strike column.

20
00:01:03.935 --> 00:01:06.695
You'll see the price
and daily change of the

21
00:01:06.695 --> 00:01:09.580
underlying to the upper
right of the Window.

22
00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.290
Above the call area,

23
00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.090
you'll see tabs for
different explorations.

24
00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.765
Click a tab or to locate
additional expiration dates,

25
00:01:17.765 --> 00:01:19.945
click on the "More" tab.

26
00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:21.620
Above the put area,

27
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.335
you will see a dropdown
menu for strike prices.

28
00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:26.570
Access this menu to change or

29
00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.620
refine the number of strike
prices displayed on the page.

30
00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.525
Hovering the cursor above

31
00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:35.585
any bid price displays
a red background.

32
00:01:35.585 --> 00:01:38.450
This indicates that by
clicking on the field,

33
00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.255
it would create an order
to sell that option.

34
00:01:41.255 --> 00:01:43.715
Hovering above any asked price,

35
00:01:43.715 --> 00:01:45.394
displays a blue background

36
00:01:45.394 --> 00:01:47.870
indicating that by
clicking on this field,

37
00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.815
it would create an order
to buy the option.

38
00:01:50.815 --> 00:01:53.250
When a single strike
is clicked upon,

39
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.710
the selected leg then

40
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:57.230
populates the strategy
builder a panel beneath

41
00:01:57.230 --> 00:01:59.180
the ocean chains
window where it can be

42
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.150
manipulated before the
order is submitted.

43
00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:06.170
Locate the desired option
strike you want to transact.

44
00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.645
Click on the relevant
price field,

45
00:02:08.645 --> 00:02:10.730
and specifically the bid price of

46
00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.080
the call option to move

47
00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.870
the leg down to the
Strategy Builder.

48
00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.150
To include the underlying stock,

49
00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.080
expand the plus symbol in the
order entry panel beneath.

50
00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.955
Locate Stock Leg and
click on the field.

51
00:02:24.955 --> 00:02:26.670
The underlying is added to

52
00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.380
the Strategy Builder display

53
00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:31.170
beneath the short
call option leg.

54
00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.620
Close the advanced display in

55
00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:37.565
the order entry panel below
by clicking the red X button.

56
00:02:37.565 --> 00:02:40.185
Now the two pieces of
the covered call are

57
00:02:40.185 --> 00:02:42.815
displayed and below
the bid-ask column,

58
00:02:42.815 --> 00:02:46.055
you'll see the price quote
for the combination.

59
00:02:46.055 --> 00:02:48.725
This is the price
of the Stock Leg

60
00:02:48.725 --> 00:02:51.890
minus the premium received
for the call option.

61
00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.720
Use the order entry panel at

62
00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:56.330
the bottom of the page
to create the order.

63
00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:59.435
Define the quantity
of options to trade.

64
00:02:59.435 --> 00:03:01.790
Generally, one options contract

65
00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.160
covers 100 shares of stock.

66
00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.380
By selecting a number of options,

67
00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.790
the software will compute

68
00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.075
the correct number of
underlying shares to transact.

69
00:03:11.075 --> 00:03:15.155
Choose the right order type
from the dropdown menu.

70
00:03:15.155 --> 00:03:17.030
If using a limit price,

71
00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.560
choose the value by clicking in

72
00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.905
the input field or simply
typing in the value.

73
00:03:21.905 --> 00:03:24.949
Select from the time
enforced dropdown,

74
00:03:24.949 --> 00:03:28.085
whether this is a
day or GTC order.

75
00:03:28.085 --> 00:03:30.695
Your order is ready to review.

76
00:03:30.695 --> 00:03:32.360
Click the "Submit" button to

77
00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.660
generate an order confirmation.

78
00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.360
When you have reviewed the
details, click "Transmit".

79
00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.570
The order is sent for execution
at the exchange and will

80
00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.304
appear in the activity panel
to the lower left of mosaic.

81
00:03:45.304 --> 00:03:48.770
To pause or interact
with an active order,

82
00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.270
click on it in they Activity

83
00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:53.610
panel and make the
relevant choice.